1
00:00:00,816 --> 00:00:04,116
(Penny:)I knew I could smell 'em.

2
00:00:04,119 --> 00:00:06,119
(Adam:)What about
from when you were a kid?

3
00:00:06,121 --> 00:00:08,721
(Sheldon:)Oh, certainly.
Uh, when I was eight years old,

4
00:00:08,724 --> 00:00:10,994
(Sheldon:)Billy Sparks cornered me
in the playground.

5
00:00:10,993 --> 00:00:13,423
(Sheldon:)I asked myself,
“What would Spock do?”

6
00:00:13,428 --> 00:00:15,958
(Sheldon:)Then I grabbed Billy
on his shoulder

7
00:00:15,964 --> 00:00:19,334
(Sheldon:)and performed
my first Vulcan nerve pinch.

8
00:00:20,736 --> 00:00:21,966
(Adam:)Did it work?

9
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:24,270
(Sheldon:)Oh, no... he broke my collarbone.

10
00:00:25,173 --> 00:00:28,713
(Sheldon:)I can still hear it click.

11
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,160
(Leonard:)That must have been
very upsetting for you.

12
00:00:30,182 --> 00:00:31,682
(Sheldon:)Oh, not at all.

13
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,550
(Sheldon:)As I said, the entire point
of emulating Spock

14
00:00:34,549 --> 00:00:36,949
(Sheldon:)was to rise above human emotion,

15
00:00:36,952 --> 00:00:39,152
(Sheldon:)which I've spent
a lifetime mastering.

16
00:00:39,154 --> 00:00:40,684
Oh... (sputters)

17
00:00:41,523 --> 00:00:43,593
(Sheldon:)Excuse me?

18
00:00:43,592 --> 00:00:45,722
(Raj:)I'm sorry.
I'm not here.

19
00:00:45,727 --> 00:00:48,197
No. You went (sputters).
What does (sputters) mean?

20
00:00:48,196 --> 00:00:49,566
(Sheldon:)Um...

21
00:00:49,564 --> 00:00:51,694
You did go (sputters).

22
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,870
Okay, fine.
Well, Sheldon, I'm no expert,

23
00:00:53,869 --> 00:00:56,469
(Penny:)but aren't you completely
missing the point of Spock?

24
00:00:56,471 --> 00:00:57,771
(Penny:)I mean, he liked to act

25
00:00:57,773 --> 00:01:00,073
(Penny:)like he had no emotions,
but he was still half human.

